WEBVTT

00:01:59.454 --> 00:02:01.246
on screen heroes have to conform to

00:02:01.246 --> 00:02:04.496
a very narrow idea about beauty
that we consider conventional.

00:02:06.079 --> 00:02:08.996
What does that mean when those images
are projected thirty feet high and

00:02:08.996 --> 00:02:11.871
the lights go down for a kid that looks
like me in Columbus, Georgia,

00:02:13.038 --> 00:02:17.079
or Muslim girl in Cardiff, Wales,
or a gay kid in Chennai.

00:02:18.246 --> 00:02:22.121
What does it mean for how we see ourselves
and how we see the world

00:02:22.746 --> 00:02:24.038
and for how the world sees us?

00:02:27.038 --> 00:02:31.246
We live in very strange times, but
I think for the most part,